  instrument        syllf1b   trial seed 000000000133ea75   600000 ticks
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  the build      DNA v66 gates the v62 F1 integrator on JAW PHASE --
                 integrate while the jaw opens, anchor toward rest
                 while it closes. One excursion per cycle.
  NOT an aim fix Derived before building: one 222 ms cycle buys 34-68
                 Hz at the taught deflection, and the clamp caps the
                 mean per-cycle excursion near 65 Hz whatever the gain.
                 Below the position decoder's measured 82.5.
  the primary    sd of CYCLE-START F1 must FALL against `v62-nogate`
                 (same jaw, no gate) AND per-cycle RANGE must not
                 collapse. Either alone is a mute dial.
  the null       for the sequence statistic: E|X-Y| over ALL cycle
                 pairs, which equals the adjacent mean exactly for
                 independent draws. Reported, gates nothing.
  untaught       silent room, no praise: what the BODY can do, as
                 `selfloop` measured the untrained creature.

